          "text": "Digital documentation is the creation, editing, formatting, storing and sharing of information in electronic documents. A good document is not simply a collection of words: its structure, readability, consistency, accuracy and presentation all matter. Word-processing software provides tools for entering text, correcting mistakes, changing appearance, organising pages and producing a document suitable for reading or printing."
